          },
          {
            "id": "p23",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "Imagine qu'on plonge une plaque de Zinc ($\\text{Zn}$) dans une solution bleue contenant des ions Cuivre ($\\text{Cu}^{2+}$).",
            "start": 1783,
            "end": 1906
          },
          {
            "id": "p24",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list",
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "1.  **Le Zinc veut donner des électrons :**",
            "start": 1908,
            "end": 1951
          },
          {
            "id": "p25",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "    $\\text{Zn} \\rightarrow \\text{Zn}^{2+} + 2e^-$ ",
            "start": 1952,
            "end": 2002
          },
          {
            "id": "p26",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "    *(Le zinc a perdu 2 électrons : c'est une **oxydation**, le Zinc est le **réducteur**).*",
            "start": 2003,
            "end": 2095
          },
          {
            "id": "p27",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list",
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "2.  **Les ions Cuivre veulent attraper ces électrons :**",
            "start": 2097,
            "end": 2153
          },
          {
            "id": "p28",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "    $\\text{Cu}^{2+} + 2e^- \\rightarrow \\text{Cu}$",
            "start": 2154,
            "end": 2203
          },
          {
            "id": "p29",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "    *(L'ion cuivre a gagné 2 électrons : c'est une **réduction**, le cuivre est **l'oxydant**).*",
            "start": 2204,
            "end": 2300
          },
          {
            "id": "p30",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list",
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "3.  **L'équation bilan (la réaction globale) :**",
            "start": 2302,
            "end": 2350
          },
          {
            "id": "p31",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "    On additionne les deux en s'assurant que les électrons s'annulent :",
            "start": 2351,
            "end": 2422
          },
          {
            "id": "p32",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "    $$\\text{Zn} + \\text{Cu}^{2+} \\rightarrow \\text{Zn}^{2+} + \\text{Cu}$$",
            "start": 2423,
